{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Griffin, battle tank has been developed as countermeasure against powerful neighbor countries. However, its designer was captured by the enemy country...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, his granddaughter got into the Griffin and take on her solo mission to rescue her grandfather!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rewind/Fast-forward: The player can use the rewind or fast-forward functions to complete the mission perfectly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saving Option: The player can save its progress anytime/anywhere and restart the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional Screen Filter: Retro, Black-White, and more filtering functions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art Gallery: Manuals and package design for the original version are available.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheat Mode: Make the gameplay easier with cheat mode (infinity life, invincible etc.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jukebox: You can play the in-game music (5 tracks) at any time.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Jungle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3387410/342551487046b519fc5bf56ad9595d2f93b206f9.jpg"},{"name":"The Dessert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3387410/ca07010d3a411fe48cd9a15952a1ad371d39e4f9.jpg"},{"name":"The Ocean","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3387410/d6c2acafac37102a061f78b6df4a29fbd1e5e784.jpg"},{"name":"The Final Boss","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3387410/4d3c93076113bbcd7cf7d4866cbe5725497bc964.jpg"},{"name":"The Jungle II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3387410/93cda7f9ad2660d14aba4fdaa78805771d07238b.